    "body": "Dear @KeplerWang, thank you for those kind words and for your interest in our work.\r\n\r\nAs stated in our [paper](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41592-021-01249-6) there is a number of images that got annotated twice due to annotation error. Each duplicate annotation will then have its own reference to the same image.\r\n\r\nInstead of pruning the annotations we selected to keep both versions and disclose which image that has dual annotations, as can be seen in our [supplementary table](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41592-021-01249-6#Sec27).\r\n\r\nI hope this is the information you where looking for, let me know if there is any other issues.\r\n\r\nKindly,\r\nChristoffer",
